From 024d8a430650420902416b621eb2171c6ff66de4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mohamed Ashry <contact@atharapp.download>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 11:58:10 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(desktop): take the connectors description out of the
 ledger list

The live connectors branch nested its description Text inside the Ledger
ul role="list", so axe reported aria-required-children [critical] on all
eight settings a11y cases when the daemon answered integrations.list with
zero rows: the list held only a span.

The description now precedes the list in the Panel body, and the ledger
renders only when there is at least one integration - no announced empty
list, and no non-listitem child. Geometry is unchanged: the ul is a zero
box (margin/padding 0, no block-start border, transparent background) and
its scrollbar-gutter is inert without overflow.
